    "Garlic Run adds five day-lawn routing puzzles using original Garlic, Spikeweed and Potato Mine mechanics, movable Garlic, a native preparation button and native save/retry/reward paths. Earlier minigames, accepted artwork, original mode IDs, unlock rules and serialized object layouts are preserved. Full original parity remains unverified.",
